<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The Last Stand</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;As Adora and Bow work together on a plan to save Glimmer from Horde Prime's ship, the young queen finds herself stuck in a cell with her worst enemy. However, as the two of them start talking, Glimmer realizes that Catra isn't the monster she always believed she was. Meanwhile, the Rebellion begins to organize its last stand against Horde Prime for Etheria's freedom. Will Adora and Bow be able to rescue Glimmer? Will Catra make amends for her past mistakes? Will the princesses gain a new, powerful ally? Will the Rebellion prevail? Or is Etheria going to become the next jewel in Horde Prime's collection?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(Or, Season 5 fanfiction!)&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>TellerOfLightAndDark</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:subject>
